templant
    - C++ source modifying tool.  in-file macro expansion through templates.
      inline function management for outlining during development, inlining
      afterwards.

coin.el
    - Emacs Lisp functions to aid misc operations on the Coin code

Legacy CVS, Autotools, and generated-documentation helpers were removed
when the project moved to Git and CMake. The remaining scripts are
development helpers and are not required for a normal CMake build.
